{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARIJIGOKU</strong> is a short, 2D pixel art <i>point-and-click</i> adventure horror game where you control <strong>Erik</strong>, a man searching for meaning in the aftermath of personal tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic adventure games, you'll explore a secluded forest, solve environmental puzzles, and use found items to move the story forward. The game uses a simple two-click control scheme:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to <strong>Interact</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right click</strong> to <strong>Examine</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the path is mostly linear, there are <strong>three possible endings</strong>, and a few decisions (or careless actions) that can lead to Erik\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save often. Curiosity has consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Around 25 minutes for experienced players; longer if you're exploring or get stuck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Includes a full interactive tutorial, accessible from the main menu.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY DESCRIPTION:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erik has lost everything: his daughter, his wife, and now, his will to keep going. Desperate to escape the weight of his grief, he drives aimlessly northward, seeking nothing but distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his car breaks down on a remote stretch of Northern Ontario highway, he wanders into the woods looking for help. What he finds is something else entirely... something that will change him forever.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spider Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/1ad9861bac1c2cffb5dee521d759cbf62b497780.jpg"},{"name":"Stick Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/b6c4c067305a2fbe04da2457e81437a4a0ee574e.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Cut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/2c732f7501ba7330b584f8c6c65e8671fe02e595.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/277770e8c21a6a5cbc8076c76990ae1501ea9e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Devoured","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/4d055e6c86ac7a74733b459d65a7d649d1772884.jpg"},{"name":"Reunited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/6f1cd8a396e721794b9a7c70f5f0be32e5d7742c.jpg"},{"name":"Trapped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/9f6320e8c1f2ca6e817c97eb57abe49f6735dd34.jpg"},{"name":"LIMBO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544260/fa9e018ab76ab40c8d724b6a743d7b7168e62338.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544260?t=1751413956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544260/7b827de26ed3015cda25fb3477d9f94e339ecc84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751413956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544260/e14f78b5fd5b6730281ce65c43a2b8029eb4b9d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751413956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544260/e14f78b5fd5b6730281ce65c43a2b8029eb4b9d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751413956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game deals with loss of a child and spouse, has mild pixel gore, and accidental death. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARIJIGOKU</strong> is a short, 2D pixel art <i>point-and-click</i> adventure horror game where you control <strong>Erik</strong>, a man searching for meaning in the aftermath of personal tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic adventure games, you'll explore a secluded forest, solve environmental puzzles, and use found items to move the story forward. The game uses a simple two-click control scheme:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to <strong>Interact</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right click</strong> to <strong>Examine</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the path is mostly linear, there are <strong>three possible endings</strong>, and a few decisions (or careless actions) that can lead to Erik\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save often. Curiosity has consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Around 25 minutes for experienced players; longer if you're exploring or get stuck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Includes a full interactive tutorial, accessible from the main menu.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY DESCRIPTION:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erik has lost everything: his daughter, his wife, and now, his will to keep going. Desperate to escape the weight of his grief, he drives aimlessly northward, seeking nothing but distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his car breaks down on a remote stretch of Northern Ontario highway, he wanders into the woods looking for help. What he finds is something else entirely... something that will change him forever.</p>","developers":["David Blomme"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544260/47dbdf52589913d39d795f84fa821b0440227ad2/header.jpg?t=1751413956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544260/831318/29889cac08936817eab3108eaeec546167dd3b08/1750859447/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742834707","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544260/831318/29889cac08936817eab3108eaeec546167dd3b08/1750859447/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742834707","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544260/831318/29889cac08936817eab3108eaeec546167dd3b08/1750859447/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742834707","id":257099786,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099786/movie480.mp4?t=1742834707","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099786/movie_max.mp4?t=1742834707"},"name":"Arijigoku","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099786/a358c38a6f98d54a9a4cb0ded94003ed5288b00b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742834707","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099786/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742834707","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099786/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742834707"}}],"name":"ARIJIGOKU","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"ARIJIGOKU - $0.99 USD","packa